{
  "id": "154",
  "title": "Little Ming is Late for Class",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-08-31",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming and Little Fang are late for class. They both have excuses for being late, but what does the teacher think of them?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/226/a4357675b5ba6d2286154b8ac866b1e8049229c3.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "上课迟到\n\n小明和小方上课迟到了。\n老师问：“你们为什么迟到？”\n小方说：“闹钟没响，睡过头了。”\n小明说：“做梦梦见老师讲课，没忍住，多听了一会儿，然后起来晚了。”\n老师说：“小明进来，小方在外面站着。”",
    "traditional": "上課遲到\n\n小明和小方上課遲到了。\n老師問：“你們為什麼遲到？”\n小方說：“鬧鐘沒響，睡過頭了。”\n小明說：“做夢夢見老師講課，沒忍住，多聽了一會兒，然後起來晚了。”\n老師說：“小明進來，小方在外面站著。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Late for Class"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明和小方上课迟到了。",
      "traditional": "小明和小方上課遲到了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hé xiǎo fāng shàng kè chí dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming and Little Fang arrived late for class."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老师问：“你们为什么迟到？”",
      "traditional": "老師問：“你們為什麼遲到？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī wèn nǐ men wèi shén me chí dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The teacher asked: “Why are you late?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小方说：“闹钟没响，睡过头了。”",
      "traditional": "小方說：“鬧鐘沒響，睡過頭了。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo fāng shuō nào zhōng méi xiǎng shuì guò tóu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Fang said: “The alarm clock didn't ring, so I overslept.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明说：“做梦梦见老师讲课，没忍住，多听了一会儿，然后起来晚了。”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“做夢夢見老師講課，沒忍住，多聽了一會兒，然後起來晚了。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō zuò mèng mèng jiàn lǎo shī jiǎng kè méi rěn zhù duō tīng le yí huì'r rán hòu qǐ lai wǎn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming said: “I dreamt that teacher was giving a lecture and I couldn't help but keep listening, so I got up late.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "老师说：“小明进来，小方在外面站着。”",
      "traditional": "老師說：“小明進來，小方在外面站著。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī shuō xiǎo míng jìn lái xiǎo fāng zài wài miàn zhàn zhe",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
